000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.      TSCALUPD.
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *C
      *C  09/17/96 JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON START AND COMPLETION DATES.
      *C   SWITCH JUL/GREG DATE ROUTINES TO "JULGREG".
      *C
      *C  01/04/2010  CA YODER  2010-00142425-001
      *C     UPDATE LOGIC ASSIGNING WORKORDER LETTER SUFFIX.
      *C
000500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
000700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT LABOR-CURR-STAT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS LCSF-STATUS.
           SELECT LABOR-CURR-STAT-FIL2
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1602
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS LCSF2-STATUS.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  LABOR-CURR-STAT-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS LCSFREC.
       01  LCSFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1601.
       FD  LABOR-CURR-STAT-FIL2
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS LCSF2REC.
       01  LCSF2REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1602.
